<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">BAHEB 59 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ku Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya Bahebeli ni kalata ikute kuyuminisha bantu ilaleshenga mbuli Yesu ncalakwanilisha bushinshimi bwingi bwa mu Cipangano ca Kaindi. Lyalalembweti mulumbe. Pali kutondeka kwapita makumi asanu ne limo (60) Ku Cipangano ca Kaindi kuli mulibuku lya Bahebeli, kulaleshenga pantangalala Yesu mwalakwanilishila bushinshimi ne ncito shalikukute Shimilumbo Mukulene wa Bayuda. Pacebo ici ili libuku lyalikuba lyelela kuyuminisha baklistu Baciyuda. Libuku lya Bahebeli lilaleshenga Yesu mwalakwanilishila Milawo ya Mose kwambeti beshimilumbo bakabule kuyandika kayi kubenga milumbo. Yesu ewalaba mulumbo walabengwa kankanda kamowa kwamuyayaya pacebo ca bwipishi bwetu. Baklistu mu masuba etu ngabacana kuyuminishiwa mu kalata ya Bahebeli kwambeti bapitilishe kukonkela Yesu Klistu uyo walapesheti tucikonshe kushoma muli Lesa, kayi nekupitilisha kushoma endiye. 12:2.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paliyawa umwinshi muntu walalemba libuku lya Bahebeli, nomba beshikuyanda kwishiba bintu bingi (Scholars) Bakute kuyeyeti ni mutumwa Paulo, nambi Luka, nambi Banabasi,</para>
  <para style="ip">Kayi cindi ncelyalembwa nkaceshibikwa sobwe, nsombi bangi bashometi lyalalembwa kacitana cishika caka ca (70 A.D.) Yelusalemu walonongeka mu (70 A.D) Nomba mulembi wa iyi kalata lambanga sha Yelusalemu katana wonongeka, libuku lya Bahebeli lya lalembelwa mumunshi wa Loma 13:24 kayi kulayeyewangeti lyalamwaiwa mu mibungano ingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Mulembi laleshengeti Yesu wapita bashinshimi ne bangelo 1:1 mpaka 4:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lapitilishinga kulesheti wapita beshimilumbo balikusebensela mu Ng'anda ya Lesa mu Yelusalemu 4:14 mpaka 7:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi mulimo wa Yesu wapita Cipangano ca Kaindi ncalabamba Lesa ne bantu kupitila mu Milawo njalapa Mose 8:1 mpaka 10:31</para>
  <para style="io1">Panyuma pakwamba Yesu ncapita byonse munshila iliyonse, mulembi lapanga malalilile angi ela kusebenseshewa 10:32 mpaka 13:17</para>
  <para style="io1">Pakupwililisha mulembi lapwililishinga kalata yakendi ne kuyuminisha bantu kayi nekupa mitende 13:18, 25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kalata yalalembelwa Bahebeli</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi a Lesa kupitila mu Mwanendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mumasuba akunyuma Lesa walikwamba kubamashali betu tunkanda twingi kayi munshila shashiyana shiyana kupitila mubashinshimi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Nomba mucindi cino camapwililisho Lesa latwambilinga kupitila mu Mwanendi, ngwalasebensesha pa kulenga kwilu ne cishi ca panshi, kayi engwalasala kwambeti pa cindi ca mapwililisho bintu byonse bikabe byakendi. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kubekema kwa bulemuneno bwa Lesa kulabonekelenga mu Mwanendi, kayi ewakoshana ne Lesa, ewabikwabilila bintu byonse kupitila mumaswi akendi angofu. Mpwalatusambisha bwipishi walaya kwikala Kwilu kucikasa calulyo ca Bwami bwa Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Bukulene bwa Mwanendi Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mwanendi Lesa nimukulene kupita bangelo, pakwinga lina ndyakute lyapita maina abangelo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakwinga kufumowa kaindi paliya mungelo Lesa ngwalambileti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Njobe Mwaname</para>
  <para style="q">lelo ame njame Baiso”</para>
  <para style="m">Lesa uliya kwambilapo mungelo naba umo kwambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ninkabe Baishi</para>
  <para style="q">neye nakabe Mwaname.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba Lesa mpwalikutuma Mwanendi wakusomona pa cishi ca panshi walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Bangelo ba Lesa bonse bela kumukambilila”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nomba kwamba sha bangelo Lesa walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Nkute kusandula bangelo</para>
  <para style="q">kuba lukupwe kayi</para>
  <para style="q">nkute kusandula basebenshi bakendi kuba nsakamwenge sha mulilo.”</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba ku Mwanendi, Lesa walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Obe Lesa,</para>
  <para style="q">bwami bwakobe nteti bukapwe!</para>
  <para style="q">Nukendeleshe bantu bakobe</para>
  <para style="q">mubululami.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Walasuna bululami ne kupela bwipishi.</para>
  <para style="q">Neco ame Lesa wakobe, ndakusala ne</para>
  <para style="q">kukupa bulemu bunene</para>
  <para style="q">kupita banobe bonse ne kukunanika mafuta akondelesha.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kayi Lesa walambeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Obe Mwami pakutanguna njobe walalenga</para>
  <para style="q">cishi capanshi kayi ne</para>
  <para style="q">makasa akobe walalenga kwilu.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ibi nibikapwe, nsombi obe nukabengaponga cindi conse.</para>
  <para style="q">Byonse nibikakuluketi byakufwala.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nukabipete pete pamo,</para>
  <para style="q">eti munganjo.</para>
  <para style="q">Kayi nibikashinte kubeti byakufwala. Nsombi amwe nkamushinti sobwe, nkamubelenge byaka byenu pakwinga buyumi bwenu nkabupu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lesa nkalambilapo umo wa bangelo kwambeti, “Ikala ku cikasa cakame ca lulyo mpaka nanshi nkakome balwani bakobe bakabe cakulyatapo myendo yakobe!” <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Sena bangelo bonse nteyo mishimu ikute kutumwa ne Lesa kuya kusebensela bantu beti bakapuluke?”</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lupulusho lunene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Twela kushako mano ku bintu mbyotwalanyumfwa kwambeti katutabula lushomo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mulumbe wa Lesa ngobalikwamba bangelo ku bamashali betu bakulukulu alikuba ancine ncine. Neco, uliyense walikubula kwanyumfwa nambi kwanyansha walapewa cisubulo celela. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Inga ngatubuleconi kupewa cisubulo na katukana kushako mano ku lupulusho lunene lulicisa? Pakwinga Mwami ewalatanguna kwamba shalupulusho ulu, kayi bantu balanyumfwa balashininkisha kulinjafweti mulumbe uwo niwa ncinencine. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lesa ewalalesheti mulumbe uwu niwa ncinencine mubintu bishikukankamanisha kayi byangofu, pakupa bipo bya Mushimu Uswepa ku muntu uliyense kwelana ne kuyanda kwakendi.</para>
  <para style="s">Uyo latutangunininga ku lupulusho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tucinsheti Lesa nkalabapapo bangelo ngofu sha kwendelesha cishi calinolino ncetulambangaponga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu naumo walambapo mu Mabala kwambeti, “Amwe Lesa anu muntu niyani kwambeti mu muyeyenga muntususu niyani kwambeti mumusheko mano? <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nendi mwalamucepeshako kwa cindi cing'ana pa bangelo benu. Nikukabeco, mwalamufwalika bulemeneno ne bulemu bwa bwami. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kwambeti, akendeleshe cena bintu byonse.”</para>
  <para style="p">Kayi cilambangeti Lesa walapa muntu bwendeleshi pa bintu byonse. Ici cilaleshengeti paliya cintu nacikaba cimo calashalapo, nomba lelo nkatulamubononga muntuyo kendelesha bintu byonse. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba ngotulabononga ni Yesu uyo walacepeshewako pa bangelo kwa cindi cing'ana. Pacino cindi watambula munshini wa bulemeneno ne bulemu, cebo ca mapensho ngwalapitamo cindi ncali kufwa. Calabeco pakwinga Lesa mu kwinamoyo kwakendi, walayandeti Yesu afwile bantu bonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Calikuba celela kwambeti Lesa shikubumba byonse, kayi eukute kulama byonse, apesheti Yesu abe welela kwine kupitila mu mapensho ngalapitamo, kwambeti banabendi bangi bese bamantemo lubasu mu bulemeneno bwakendi. Pakwinga Yesu elabatangunininga ku lupulusho. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesu nakabaswepeshe kubwipishi kwambeti, nendi pamo nabo beti bakabe baswepa bakabe ne Ishabo umo. Ecebo cakendi Yesu nkela kunyumfwa nsoni kubakuweti, banse bame. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Walamba kuli Lesa eti, “Ninkabambile banse bame sha bintu mbyomwalensa, ninkembile lwimbo ne kumulumbanya pa cindi ncetulabungananga pamo” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “Ni nkacinke manungo mu makasa a Lesa.” Lino kayi walambeti, “Ndili pamo ne bana mbwalampa Lesa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Aba mbwalakungeti, bana ni bantu bakute munyemfu ne milopa. Nendi Yesu walaba muntu welana ne bantu bonse. Walenseco kwambeti, kupitila mu lufu lwakendi, akamononge Satana uyo ukute ngofu sha lufu <verse number="15" style="v"/>kwambeti alubule bantu balikuba bekatwa busha mu buyumi bwabo cebo ca kwambeti balikutina lufu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nicakubinga kwambeti nkakute kunyafwa bangelo sobwe, calembwa mu Mabala kwambeti, nsombi abo bali mu musemano wa Abulahamu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Neco ici cilapandululungeti wela kuba mbuli banse bendi mu bintu byonse, kwambeti abe Shimilumbo Mukulene washomeka kayi wankumbo mu ncito yakendi ya kusebensela Lesa, kwambeti bwipishi bwa bantu bulekelelwe. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pacino cindi ukute ngofu sha kunyamfwilisha bantu balasunkwanga, mbuli Yesu ncalapenga mpwalikusunkwa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu wapita Mose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Mobanse betu omwaswepa kayi omwalakwiwa ne Lesa, kamuyeyanga sha Yesu walatumwa kwambeti abe Shimilumbo Mukulene wa lushomo ndotulasuminishinga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Walikuba washomeka kuli Lesa uyo walamusaleti asebense ncito iyi, mbuli Mose ncalashomeka mu ncito ya mung'anda ya Lesa <verse number="3" style="v"/>Muntu lebakanga ng'anda ukute kupewa bulemu kupita ng'anda njalebakanga. Neco Yesu walemekwa kupita Mose. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nicakubinga ng'anda ikute kwibakwa ne muntu, nomba Lesa eukute kwibaka bintu byonse. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mose walashomeka mu ncito ya mung'anda ya Lesa, kayi walikwamba ibyo Lesa mbyalikuyanda kwamba kuntangu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba Klistu Mwanendi Lesa washomeka mukwendelesha ng'anda ya Lesa.Uku ekwambeti njafwe ng'anda ya Lesa na tubula buyowa ne kuba bashinisha mukupembelela kwetu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupumwina kwa bantu ba Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco mbuli Mushimu Uswepa ncolambangeti, “Na lelo munyumfwa liswi lya Lesa, <verse number="8" style="v"/>kamutayumisha myoyo mbuli ncebalensa ba mashali benu bakulukulu bushiku mbobalamubukila Lesa, mu cinyika mpobalamukalalisha Lesa.” <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lesa walambeti; Balanjelekesha, nambi balabona ncendalabenshila mu byaka makumi ana. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ecebo ncendalakalila ne kubambileti, nkababikako myoyo yabo kuli njame kayi balakananga ku konkela Milawo yakame. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ndalakalala ne kulumbileti, nteti bakengilepo mumusena wakame wa kupumwina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mobanse cetukani, kapataba muntu pakati penu ukute moyo waipa wabula lushomo, wela kumufunya kuli Lesa muyumi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino kwambeti mubule kumantwa ne bwipishi ne kuba bayuma myoyo, nyamfwanani umo ne munendi masuba onse ngomulambanga mu Mabala kwambeti “Lelo.” <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakwinga twense tobasebenshi banendi Klistu, na tupitilishowa kwikatisha lushomo mpaka kumapwilisho a buyumi bwetu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mabala alambangeti, Na lelo munyumfwa liswi lya Lesa. Kamutayumisha myoyo mbuli ba mashali benu bakulukulu mpobalamubukila Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Anu ni bantu cini balanyumfwa liswi lya Lesa, kayi ne kumubukila? Nibantu bonse mbwali kutangunina Mose pakubafunya mu Injipito. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Inga nibani balakalalisha Lesa kwa byaka makumi ana? Ni bantu balikwipisha abo balafwila mu cinyika kayi bitumbi byabo byalashala mbwee mucinyika. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Inga ni bani Lesa mbwalalumbilileti, “nteti bakengile mu cishi ncali kuyanda kubapeti bapumwininemo? Sena ntebamo bamo basa balamubukila?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Apa tulabono kwambeti calabalisha kwingila mu cishi cisa ni kubula lushomo.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">Lino Lesa walatulaya kwambeti tukatambule kupembelela nkwalikwamba, twela kuba bantu bacetuka kwambeti kapatakaba muntu naba umo eshakalilwe kutambula kupembelela uku kwalalaiwa. <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino Lesa walatulayeti tukatambule kupumwina nkwalikwamba, twela kuba bantu bacetuka kwambeti kapatakaba muntu naba umo eshakalilwe kutambula kupumwina uko nkwalalaya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pakwinga nenjafwe tulanyumfu Mulumbe Waina mbuli naboyo ncebalonyumfwa. Mulumbe ngobalanyumfwa paliya ncewalensa, pakwinga balanyumfowa baliya kutambula mu lushomo sobwe. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neco afwe otwashoma Lesa tulakutambulunga kupumwina nkwalatulaya. Cili mbuli mwine ncalambeti, “Ee, ndalakalala ne kulumbileti, ‘Nteti bakengile mucishi ncendalikuyanda kubapeti bakapumwinemo.’”</para>
  <para style="p">Lesa walambeco nambi calikubeti ncito yakendi ya kulenga cishi yalikuba yapwa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga mu Mabala napamo palembweti, “Lesa mpwalapwisha ncito yakendi yonse walapumwina pa busuba bwa busanu ne bubili.” <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kayi pa makani opelawa Lesa walambeti, “Nteti bakengilepo mu musena wakendi wa kupumwinamo.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Lesa walabambeti nabambi nibakengile mu mumusena wa kupumwininamo. Nomba abo balatanguna kunyumfwa Mulumbe Waina baliya kwingilamo cebo ca kukana kushoma ncalamba Lesa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ecebo Lesa ncalabambila bushiku nabumbi ubo mbwalakungeti “Lelo”. Ebushiku mbwalikwamba Lesa kupitila muli Dafeti, mpopalapita byaka bingi mpwalamba mu Mabala awa ngotulambapo kendi alambangeti, “Na lelo munyumfwe liswi lya Lesa, kamutayumisha myoyo” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na Yoswa nalacikonsha kwingisha bantu mu kupumwina nkwalalaya Lesa, nshinga Lesa nalabula kwambapo sha busuba nabumbi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pacebo ico, bushiku bwa kupumwina kwa bantu ba Lesa mpobucili, mbuli Lesa ncalapumwina pa busuba bwa busanu ne bubili. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga muntu lengili mukupumwina kwa Lesa ekwambeti lapumwini ku ncito shakendi mbuli Lesa ncalapumwina mpwalapwisha ncito shakendi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neco katwelekeshani cangofu kukutambula kupumwina uko, kutineti kapataba muntu naba umo eshakalilwe kukutambula cebo ca kukana kushoma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pakwinga Maswi a Lesa nayumi kayi akute ngofu. Alumata kupita cibeshi calumata konse konse. Akute kutimbula pakati ne kushika pekala buyumi ne mushimu, kayi ne pekala mafupa ne mikolofupa. Kayi Maswi a Lesa akute kuyubulula bintu mbyebakute kuyeya ne mbyebasuni bantu. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Paliya cintu ncela kwalilwa Lesa kucibona, ukute kubibona bilengwa byonse mbuli ncebibele pakwinga byonse bili pantangalala, ni kulyendiye nkotwela kucanika ne mulandu wa bintu mbyotwali kwinsa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesu e Shimulumbo Mukulene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Neco katupitilishani kwitatisha mwangofu lushomo lwetu, pakwinga tukute Shimulumbo Mukulene wapita bonse, uyo walakengila kwilu kuli Lesa. Uyu ni Yesu Mwanendi Lesa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shimulumbo Mukulene ngotukute nteyo wela kubula kutunyumfwila nkumbo otwalefuka sobwe. Shimulumbo wetu walasunkwa munshila shonse mbuli ncetulasunkwanga, nsombi nendi paliya bwipishi mbwalensa. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Neco katubani bashinisha kayi katuseng'enani pepi ku cipuna ca Bwami bwa Lesa uko kuli kwina moyo, nkweshakatunyumfwile nkumbo ne kutubonesha kwina moyo pa cindi ncetulayandanga lunyamfo.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Shimilumbo Mukulene uliyense ukute kusalwa kufuma pakati pa bantu banendi, ne kubikwa ne Lesa kwambeti abaimaninenga kuli Lesa. Ncito yakendi ni yakubenga bipo ne milumbo kwambeti Lesa alekelele bwipishi bwa bantu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Pacebo cakwambeti neye walefuka, encakute kubela wabomba moyo kubantu bakute kwinsa byaipa mwakubula kwinshiba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Neco pakuba muntu walefuka nkela kutwala milumbo kuli Lesa ya kufunya bwipishi bwa bantu banendi bonka sobwe, nsombi ne bwipishi bwakendi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nkakute kulisala ne kulipa bulemu mwine bwakuba Shimilumbo Mukulene sobwe, nsombi Lesa eukute kumukuweti abe Shimilumbo Mukulene mbuli ncalakuwa Aloni.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Copeleco, neye Klistu uliya kulipa bulemu mwine bwakuba Shimilumbo Mukulene sobwe, nsombi Lesa ewalamwambileti, “Njobe mwaname ame lelo ndaba Baiso.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kayi mu Mabala, napambi palembweti, “Nukabengowa Shimilumbo cindi conse mbuli bushimilumbo bwa Melekisedeki.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesu kacili muntu pacishi capanshi walikupaila ne kusenga kuli Lesa mwakompolola kalila misonshi kuli Lesa uyo wela kumupulusha ku lufu. Cebo cakulicepesha kayi ne kulibenga, Lesa walamukumbula. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nikukabeti Yesu walikuba Mwanendi Lesa, mapensho ngalakumanya alamwiyisha kunyumfwila Lesa. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpwalaba welela cakupwililila walaba citatiko calupulusho lwa cindi conse ku bantu balamunyumfwilinga. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Neco Lesa walamubika kuba Shimilumbo Mukulene, bushimilumbo bwa Melekisedeki.</para>
  <para style="s">Kucenjeshewa kutaleka lushomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nkute makani angi akwamba, nomba ayuma kwamba kuli njamwe pakwinga nkamukute kunyumfwa bwangu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambi canga celela kwambeti pacino cindi mube beshikwiyisha, mulayandanga muntu wela kumwiyisha biyo bitanshi bya maswi a Lesa. Mu musena wakwambeti mulye byakulya byakutamfuna, mucili mwelela kunwowa mukupa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Uliyense ucinwa mukupa ulyeti mwana kateta wabula lwinshibo mubintu byalulama. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba byakulya byakutamfuna ni bya makulene, abo bela kusebensesha ngofu sha lwinshibo lwakushiyanisha pakati pa caina ne caipa kwelela.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Neco katuyani pantangu mu ciyisho calumbuluka, katushiyani ciyisho citanshi ncetwalayishiwa cilambanga sha Ciklistu. Nkatwela kayi kutala lulindi lwakubwelela kunyuma ku ncito shabulyo, ne motwela kushomena Lesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ne ciyisho ca lubatisho, ne cinga ca kubika makasa pabantu ne ca kupunduka ku bafu, kayi ne sha cisubulo ca cindi conse Lesa nceti akape. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Katuyani pantangu, na Lesa utusuminisha ngatwinseco nditu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Inga bantu balashiya lushomo lwabo ngabalapeconi? Kakuli Lesa walabamunikilapo kendi, balatelelako cipo ca kwilu ne kutambulako Mushimu Uswepa pamo ne banabo. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Balatelelako kwina kwa Maswi a Lesa, kayi ne ngofu nsheti akaboneshe Lesa mu cindi cilesanga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba lino abo balacileka kushoma Lesa, nkacela kukonsheka kubabwesheti balape, pakwinga balabangeti balamupoponga pa lusanda kayi Mwanendi Lesa ne kumusebanya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Bulongo bukute kunwina menshi a mfula ikute kuloka cindi conse. Papita cindi pakute kupula mu mena ukute kupa cakulya, ico cili colwe cakondwelesha mulimi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba na mu bulongo mumena myunga ne lubamba, bulongobo buliya ncito. Neco buli pepi kushinganwa ne Lesa pa cindi ciliconse celela ne kubutenta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mobanse omwasunika, nambi tulambangeco, nkatulamutonshanyanga. Twashometi mukute bintu byaina byela kumutangunina ku lupulusho. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lesa walulama cindi conse, neco nakapitilishe kwanuka ncito shenu nshemwalikwinsa, kayi ne lusuno ndomukute lwakunyamfwa baklistu banenu kayi mulapitilishinga kwinseco. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tulayandangeti uliyense mulikoto lyenu apitilishe kangwabu mpaka kumapwililisho, kwambeti ncemulapembelelenga mpaka cikaboneke. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nkatusuni kwambeti mube batolo sobwe, nsombi kamubani bantu bashoma balibambila kutambula ibyo Lesa mbyalashomesha kupitila mu lushomo ne moyonteka.</para>
  <para style="s">Lulayo lwa Lesa ni lwakubinga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Pa cindi Lesa ncalamushomesha Abulahamu kwambeti nakamupe cintu, walalumbileti nakense kwelana ne kushomesha kwakendi. Pakwinga nkapalikuba naumbi wamupita, ecebo cakendi Lesa walalumbila pa Lina lyakendi mwine. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Ndakushomeshengeti ninkakupe colwe kayi ninkafulishe mukowa wakobe.” <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco Abulahamu walapembelela ca moyonteka, kayi walatambula ico Lesa ncalamushomesha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lino bantu balumbilanga bakute kulumbila palina lya muntu wabapita, kulumbila kwa ncinencine kulico ekukute kupwisha ntota shabo. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lesa walayanda kubabonesha abo beti bakatambule mbyalabashomesha kwambeti nakense kwelana ne bubambo bwakendi. Ecebo ncalalumbilila ne kukonkomesha mukushomesha kwakendi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neco ibi bintu bibili, kushomesha kayi ne kulumbila, cakubinga nibikenshike pakwinga Lesa nkabepe kayi nkashinti sobwe. Afwe otwala fwambila kulyendiye akuyuba tukute kuyuminishiwa pakumbelela nkwalatupa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Uku kupembelela kwelaneti mukoboco wa buyumi bwetu. Ekulatupanga kubula buyowa, kayi ne kutatenkana nikukatushikishe kwilu mu Ng'anda ya Lesa kunsa kwa cikwisa cashinkilisha pakati ne kuya kwingila mukati mu Musena Waswepa. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Uko Yesu nkwalaba mutanshi kwingilako cebo cetu, walaba Shimilumbo Mukulene wa cindi citapu mbuli ncebwalikuba bushimilumbo bwa Melekisedeki.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bushimilumbo bwa Melekisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Uyu Melekizedeki walikuba mwami wa Salemu, walikuba kayi shimilumbo wa Lesa wa Ngofu Shonse. Melekizedeki walapula nekuya kukumana ne Abulahamu ne kumuleleka, Abulahamu mpwalikufuma ku nkondo uko nkalakoma bami bana. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Popelapo Abulahamu walamanta ca likumi pa bintu byonse mbyalikukute ne kupa Melekizedeki. Lina lyakwambeti Melekizedeki lipandulululungeti, “Mwami wa bululami”. Pakwinga Salemu cilapadululunga “lumuno” Ecebo cakendi Melekizedeki lakwiwangeti “Mwami wa lumuno”. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nkalikukute baishi, nambi banyina, nambi cikokwe, nambi citatiko nambi mapwililisho. Melekizedeki walikubeti Mwanendi Lesa, kayi ni shimilumbo wa muyayaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kamubonani bukulene bwa Melekizedeki! Cikokwe wetu Abulahamu walamupa ca likumi ca bintu byonse mbyalalamuna balwani bakendi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kayi beshimilumbo ba mumukowa wa Levi Milawo ya Mose yalabasuminisha kumantapo ca likumi pa bintu mbyobakute Baislayeli, mikowa yabo yalafuma mubukome bwa Abulahamu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Melekizedeki nkalikuba wa mumukowa wa Levi sobwe, necikabeco walamantapo ca likumi pa bintu mbyalikukute Abulahamu, kayi walamuleleka muntuyo walatambula malayano a Lesa. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Apa paliya kutonshanya sobwe, uyo lalelekenga nimukulene kupita uyo lalelekwanga. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Beshimilumbo beshikumantapo ca likumi ni bantu beshi kufwa, nomba nendi Melekizedeki ca likumi ncalamanta Mabala alambangeti nimuyumi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mpani ng'ambeti, Abulahamu mpwalapa ca likumi, Levi kupitila mu bana bendi abo balikumanta ca likumi, nendi walapa ca likumi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga Levi walikatana asemwa pa cindico Abulahamu mpwalakumana ne Melekizedeki.Pakwinga walikacili mubukome bwa Abulahamu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pabushimilumbo bwa Balevi epalikuba pebakwa Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Baislayeli. Lino nekwalikubeti ncito ya beshimilumbo yalikuba yelela kwine, nshinga nekwalabula kuyandiketi shimilumbo naumbi ese, uyo lafumunga mu bushimilumbo bwa Melekizedeki, bwabula kuba bwa Aloni. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Neco palaba kushinta kwa bushimilumbo, kayi pela kuba kushinta kwa Milawo. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Muntu ngotulambanga ni Mwami uyo wabulapo muntu naumbi wa mumukowa wakendi walabapo shimilumbo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ee, tucinsheti walasemenwa mu mukowa wa Yuda, nomba Mose uliya kuwambapo mukowa uwu mpwalikwamba sha beshimilumbo.</para>
  <para style="s">Shimilumbo ulyeti Melekizedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iyi nkani ilanyumfwiki cena, shimilumbo naumbi laboneke uyo ulyeti Melekizedeki. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Lesa walamubika kuba shimilumbo kwakubula kukonkela milawo ne malailile a mikowa yabantu, nsombi kupitila mu ngofu shakendi sha buyumi butapu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mabala alambangeti, “Nukabe shimilumbo wa muyayaya, mbuli bushimilumbo bwa Melekizedeki.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neco Milawo yakaindi ilafumupo pakwinga nkayali kukute ngofu, yalikuba yalefuka kayi yabula kwelela. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Pakwinga Milawo Lesa njalapa Mose nkayali kucikonsha kululamika bintu byonse sobwe. Lino tulapewa ngotwali kupembelela uyo wela kututwala pepi ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nacimbi kayi nicakwambeti beshimilumbo nabambi mpobali kubikwa kuba beshimilumbo Lesa nkali kulumbilapo sobwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu mpwalaba shimilumbo palaba kulumbila, Lesa walalumbileti, Mwami Lesa walalumbileti, nteti nkashinte muyeyo wakame, “Njobe shimilumbo wa cindi conse.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neco kupusana uku, kulamubikinga Yesu kuba cishomesho ca cipangano caina kupita. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kupusana nakumbi ni uku kwalikuba beshimilumbo bangi, nsombi lufu elwalikubalisha kupitilisha ncito yabo sobwe. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Nomba nendi Yesu nimuyumi cindi conse, kayi ncito yakendi yakuba shimilumbo nkaituntulukili ku muntu naumbi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Walibambila kupulusha cakupwililila bantu mbwalatangunininga kuli Lesa kupitila mulyendiye, pakwinga nendi nimuyumi cindi conse kayi ukute kubasengelako kuli Lesa. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ee,Yesu e Shimilumbo Mukulene ngotulayandanga. Waswepa, wabula kantongo kalikonse, nambi bwipishi. Wapusana ne njafwe tobabwipishi, nendi walapundushiwa ne kuya kwikala Kwilu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesu nkalipo eti beshimilumbo bamakulene nabambi, nendi nkalayandikinga kutwala milumbo yabwipishi bwakendi ne bwa bantu nabambi busuba ne busuba. Nendi walatwala mulumbo umo kankanda kamowa cindi ncalalibenga. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Milawo ya Lesa njalapa Mose yalikusuminisha bantu babula kuswepa kuba beshimilumbo bamakulene, nomba cipangano ca Lesa ncalensa kulumbilapo, ico calesa panyuma pa milawo, calabika Mwana walulama kwa muyayaya.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu e Shimilumbo Wetu Mukulene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Cintu cinene ncotulambanga pano nici, afwe tukute Shimilumbo Mukulene uyo wekala kucikasa cakululyo kwa Cipuna ca Bwami ca Lesa mubulemeneno kwilu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Lasebensenga eti Shimilumbo Mukulene mu Musena Waswepeshesha, mu tente yancinencine yabula kwibakwa ne makasa abantu, nsombi yalebakwa ne Mwami mwine.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Incito ya Shimilumbo Mukulene uliyense ni yakutwala milumbo yabanyama ne bipo nabimbi kuli Lesa, neco neye Shimilumbo Mukulene wetu wela kuba ne cintu cakubenga. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nacili pano pa cishi, nalabula kubapo Shimilumbo sobwe, pakwinga mpobali beshimilumbo bakute kubenga bipo byasuminishiwa ne Milawo ya Mose. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Incito njobakute kusebensa beshimilumbo aba ni cinkoshanya nambi mufunsha wa bintu bili kwilu. Celana ne ncalikuba Mose. Mpwalikuyanda kwibaka Tente ya Lesa walamwambileti, “Ubambe ndendende mbuli ncewalaleshiwa pa mulundu.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nomba lino, Yesu lapewa ncito ya bushimilumbo yapita yabo, mbuli cipangano Lesa ncalabamba pakati palyendiye ne bantu ncecapitapo kwina, apa epebakwa bipangano a bintu byaina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Cipangano citanshi ne calikubula kampenda, nshinga nepalabula kuyandika kwa cipangano nacimbi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nomba Lesa walacaneti bantu bakendi bakute kampenda, pakwambeti, Mwami lambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Mumasuba alesanga</para>
  <para style="q">ninkabambe cipangano calinolino</para>
  <para style="q">ne Baislayeli kayi ne</para>
  <para style="q">bamukowa wa Yuda.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nteti cikabeti cipangano</para>
  <para style="q">ncendalapangana ne bamashali babo</para>
  <para style="q">pabusuba busa mpondalabamanta pa cikasa cakame</para>
  <para style="q">ne kubafunya mu Injipito.</para>
  <para style="q">Nkabali kuba bashomeka kucipangano ncendalapangana nabo.</para>
  <para style="q">Nenjame ndiyawa kushako mano”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Lelo Mwami lambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ici ecipangano</para>
  <para style="q">ncendapangananga ne Baislayeli</para>
  <para style="q">mu masuba alesanga.</para>
  <para style="q">Ninkabike Milawo yakame mu miyeyo yabo kayi</para>
  <para style="q">ninkailembe mumyoyo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q">Ninkabe Lesa wabo</para>
  <para style="q">nabo nibakabe bantu bakame.”</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Paliya eshakayishe</para>
  <para style="q">muntu munendi sobwe,</para>
  <para style="q">nambi kwambila munendi eti,</para>
  <para style="q">komwishiba Lesa.</para>
  <para style="q">Pakwinga bonse nibakanjishibe</para>
  <para style="q">kutatikila ku kanike kushika ku mukulene.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ninkabalekelele bwipishi bwabo kayi nteti nkanukepo cilubo cabo.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Lino Lesa pakwamba sha Cipangano calinolino, ekwambeti cipangano ca kaindi cilabongosoko, kayi cintu ciliconse cacekula ne kubongosoka cilipepi kushimangana.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kukambila kwa pacishi ca panshi ne kwa kwilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Cipangano ca kaindi calikukute milawo ya nkambililo kayi ne milawo yapa musena wa kukambililapo webakwa ne bantu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Bantu balebaka Tente ya Lesa. Cipinda cakutanguna calikukwiweti Musena Waswepa. Umo mucipinda mwalikuba pakubika lampi, tebulu kayi ne shinkwa walikubengwa kuli Lesa <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kunyuma kwa cikwisa cashinkilila pakati, kwalikuba musena walikukwiweti, Musena Waswepeshesha. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Umu emwalikuba nteme ya golide pakutentela lubani, ne libokoshi lya cipangano lyamatwa ne golide kayi ne nsupa ya golide mwalikuba mana. Kayi mwalikuba nkoli ya Aloni isa yalasonsa matewu, ne mabwe abili asa palikuba palembwa Milawo likumi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pa libokoshi palikuba Bakelubi bakubesa balikwimanina bulemeneno bwa Lesa, mifunsha ya mapepe abo yalikuba yafukatila pa musena wakulelekelapo bwipishi. Nomba cindi cino nteco cakwamba byonse ncebyalikuba sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ubu ebubambo bwa bintu ncebyalikuba. Beshimilumbo balikwingila mu cipinda cakutanguna ca Tente busuba ne busuba kuya kusebensa ncito shabo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Enka Shimilumbo Mukulene ewalikwingila mu cipinda catubili ca Tente kankanda kamo pa caka. Walikumantilila milopa yakubenga kuli Lesa cebo ca bwipishi bwakendi, ne bwa bantu banendi abo balikwipisha mwakutenshiba. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mushimu Uswepa ulatwiyishinga pantangalala pabubambo ubu kwambeti nshila ya kwingilila mu Musena Waswepeshesha, nkaina icaluka pakwinga tente yakutanguna mpoicili. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ici ecitondesho cilatondekenga ku cindi cino. Uku ekwambeti bipo bya milumbo ya banyama byalikubengwa kuli Lesa nkabyela kululamika moyo wa muntu lakambililinga Lesa. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga bintu ibyo bilambangowa pabyakulya ne pa byakunwa kayi ne pamiyambo ya kobenkana ya nswepeshelo. Yonseyi ni milawo yakunsa yasebensanga kushikila cindi Lesa nceti akekalike bubambo bwalinolino.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Nomba, Klistu Shimilumbo Mukulene wa bintu byaina bili pano lashiki. Tente njala sebenselengamonga ni inene, kayi yelela kwine, nteyo yebakwa ne makasa abantu sobwe, uku ekwambeti nteyo ya lubasu lwa pa cishi capanshi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Klistu mpwalengila mu Musena Waswepeshesha uli mutente walengilamo kankanda kamowa. Uliya kumantilila milopa ya mpongo, ne ya ng'ombe kwambeti abengeti milumbo, nsombi walamanta milopa yakendi yalatuletela lupulusho lwamuyayaya. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Milopa ya mpongo, ne yang'ombe kayi ne milota ya ng'ombe nimbwa bacende njali kusansila bantu babula kuswepa pamenso a Lesa. Kuswepesha uku kwalikubowa kwa kuswepesha mubili. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Neco ici pakubeco, inga yalo milopa ya Klistu inga ishika kupeyo! Kupitila mu Mushimu wamuyayaya, neye walalibenga kuba mulumbo welela cakupwililila kuli Lesa. Milopa ya Klistu nikaswepeshe miyeyo yetu kushiya miyambo yakuswepesha yabula nchito, kwambeti tusebensele Lesa muyumi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pacebo ici Klistu elabambanga cipangano ca linolino, neco abo balakwiwa ne Lesa bela kutambula colwe citapu ico ncalalaya, ingacibeco pakwinga pali lufu lwa muntu ulo lwalasungulula bantu kubwipishi mbobalikwinsa kapacili cipangano cakutanguna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Na pali cipangano calembwa cakushiyila buboni muntu umbi, pela kuba lushinisho lwakwambeti uyo walacilemba lafu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Pakwinga cipangano ngaciba cabula ncito na muntu walacilemba ucili muyumi, nsombi na lafu empocikute kusebensa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi cipangano cakutanguna calabako cebo cakusebensha milopa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Cakutanguna Mose walabambila bantu byonse byalalembwa mu Milawo ya Lesa. Encali kumantila milopa ya ng'ombe ne yampongo ne kwisankanya ne menshi, ne kusansa palibuku lya Milawo, kayi ne pa bantu bonse, pakusebensesha katondo ka hisopu kasungililwa bweya bwa mbelele bufubela. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Walambeti, “Iyi ni milopa ilaboneshengeti cipangano ncalamba Lesa mwela kucikonka.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kayi Mose walikusansa milopa pa Tente ya Lesa ne pa bintu byonse byakusebensesha pa kukambilila. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kwelana ne Milawo ya Mose, bintu byonse byali kuswepa ne milopa, kayi kwambeti bwipishi bulekelelwe palikuyandika kwita milopa.</para>
  <para style="s">Klistu ewela kufunya bwipishi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ibi bintu byemaninakowa bintu bya kwilu binebine, ibyo byela kuswepeshewa munshila ilico. Nomba kwambeti bintu bya kwilu biswepeshewe, bilayandikinga milumbo inene yaina kupitilila. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Lino Klistu uliya kwingila mu Musena Waswepa walebakwa ne makasa abantu sobwe uwo walikubowa cinkosha ca winewine. Nendi walengila Kwilu uko nkwalatwimanininga kuli Lesa pa cino cindi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shimilumbo Mukulene wa Bayuda walikwingila mu Musena Waswepeshesha kankanda kamo pa caka, kali wamanta milopa yanyama. Nomba nendi Klistu uliya kulibenga mulumbo wakendi tunkanda twingi sobwe. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Necalikubeco, nalikupitowa mu makatasho angi kufumowa kukulengwa kwa cishi capanshi. Nomba lino pakuboneti mapwililisho a cishi ali pepi, nendi walabonekowa kankanda kamo kwisa kufunya bwipishi kupitila mu mulumbo ngwalalibenga mwine. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Muntu wela kufwa kankanda kamo nanshi, kufumapo lombolosho <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kwelana neco, Klistu nendi walatwala mulumbo kankanda kamowa kufunya bwipishi bwa bantu bangi. Nakese katubili nteko kusa kufunya bwipishi sobwe, nsombi kwisa kupulusha bantu balamupembelelenga.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Milawo yalapewa ku Bayuda nkayalikuba yakwana kuba citondesho cakwana ca lushomo lwa bintu binebine, ni mufunshowa wabintu byaina byalikwisa kuntangu. Milumbo imoimo yalikubengwa lyonse caka ne caka. Inga milumbo ilicisa yalabikwa ne Milawo inga ibalulamikeconi cakupwililila bantu balesanga kuli Lesa? <verse number="2" style="v"/>Na, cancine ncine bantu balakambililinga Lesa baswepa cakupwililila nshinga nebatalibono bwipishi, kayi nibalaleka kubenga milumbo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ca ncinencine ni cakwambeti, milumbo njobali kubenga lyonse caka ne caka yali kubanushowa bwipishi bwabo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga milopa ya ng'ombe, kayi ne ya mpongo nkayela kufunya bwipishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi mpwalesa Klistu pa cishi capanshi walambeti, “Amwe Lesa nkamwalayanda milumbo ne bipo, nsombi mwalamambila mubili. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nkamwalayandeti banyama babatentenga pa nteme, nambi milumbo yeshi kufunya bwipishi.” <verse number="7" style="v"/>Neco ndalambeti, “Amwe Lesa, njame pano ndesakwinsa lusuno lwenu, mbuli ncecalalembwa palinjame mu Milawo ya Mose.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Citanshi walambeti, “Nkamwalayanda, nambi kukondwa ne milumbo ne bipo nambi kutentwa kwa banyama pa nteme kwambeti bafunye bwipishi.” Klistu walambeci nikukabeti milumbo yonseyi yali kubengwa kukonkela Milawo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kayi walambeti, “Njame pano kwambeti njinse luyando lwenu amwe Lesa.” Neco Lesa walaifunyapo milumbo yakaindi, walabika Klistu kuba mulumbo mu musena wa milumbo yakaindi milumbo yakaindi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Pakwinga Yesu Klistu walensa ncalikuyanda Lesa, anu twense tulaswepe ku bwipishi kupitila mu mubili wakendi ngwalabenga mulumbo kenshi kamowa kwa muyayaya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Shimilumbo uliyense Muyuda walikusebensa ncito yakendi busuba ne busuba, nsombi nakenshico mankanda mangi, milumbo iyi nkayali kufunya bwipishi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nomba Yesu walabenga mulumbo umowa wakufunya bwipishi kwa muyayaya, ne kuya kwikala ku cikasa cakululyo ca Lesa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Uko nkwalapembelelenga kushika cindi Lesa nceshakabike balwani bakendi kuba ca kulyatapo myendo yakendi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ne mulumbo umowa lalete bululami bwa muyayaya kubantu mbwalaswepeshe bwipishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nawo Mushimu Uswepa ulatupanga bukamboni bwakendi. Citanshi Lesa lambangeti, <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ici ecipangano nceshi nkasuminishane nabo mu masuba alesanga, Ninkabike milawo yakame mumu miyeyo yabo myoyo yabo ne kwilemba.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kayi lambangeti, “Nteti nkanukepo bwipishi bwabo nambi ncito shabo shaipa sobwe.” <verse number="18" style="v"/>Neco, Lesa pakulekelela kulico, mulumbo weshikufunya bwipishi nkaulayandikinga sobwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Katuseng'enani kuli Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, twasunguluka kuya kwingila mu Musena Waswepeshesha cebo ca lufu lwa Yesu. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Walatucalwila nshila ya linolino yeshikupa buyumi kupita mu cikwisa calikutushinkilila ku Musena Waswepeshesha, uku ekwambeti kupitila mu mubili wakendi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tukute Shimilumbo Mukulene lendeleshenga ng'anda ya Lesa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Neco tiyeni tuseng'ene kuli Lesa ne moyo waloma ne lushomo lwa ncinencine. Myoyo yaswepa italitibuku. Ne mibili yasambishiwa ne menshi abula mashilo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Katwikatishani camakasa abili kupembelela nkotulasuminishinga, pakwinga twashometi Lesa wasunga cipangano cakendi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Katubani basakamana umo ne munendi, tunyamfwanenga umo ne munendi ne kulesha lusuno kayi ne kwinsa ncito shaina. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Katutaleka kubungana pamo, mbuli nabamo ncebakute cinga ca kutabungana pamo. Nsombi katuyuminishananga umo ne munendi cindi conse, bonani busuba bwakwisa Mwami bulaseng'enenga pepi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neco kuliya mulumbo naumbi weshukafunye bwipishi na katupitilisha kwinsa bwipishi kakuli tucinshi ca ncinencine. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Twensangeco, ninshi cetu nikupembelelowa lombolosho lulesanga ne mulilo uyosha weshukashine bantu balakananga Lesa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Muntu labulunga kukonkela Milawo ya Mose, wela kufwa kwakubula kumunyumfwila luse na pali bantu babili nambi bangi balamwinshili bukamboni. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Inga kulyeconi kuli beshikusampula Mwanendi Lesa? Balabonongeti milopa ya cipangano ca Lesa yalabaswepesha bwipishi ni yabulyo? Inga neye muntu latukananga Mushimu Uswepa wa Lesa uwo ulatuleshenga kwina moyo kwakendi Kamuyeyani kukonempa kwacisubulo nceti cikabe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Tumwinshi walambeti, “Ninkabweshele, kayi ninkalipile.” Ne uyo walambeti, “Mwami nakomboloshe bantu bakendi.” <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ni cintu cikute kuyosha kwine na Lesa muyumi ukwikata kwambeti akupe cisubulo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kamwanukani ncecalikuba kuli njamwe mu cindi cakunyuma, mu masuba asa. Lesa kali lamumunikili kendi, mwalapita mumapensho angi, nsombi muliya kukomwa mu kulwisha kwenu. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Bantu balikumutukana ne kumupensha pantangalala tweshi twingi, nacimo cindi mwalikuyanda kuliwalapo pa bantu balikupenshewa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mwalamantako lubasu mu mapensho a bakaili, kayi mpobalamumantila bintu byonse mwalashala kamuli mwakondwa, pakwinga mwalikucinsheti mukute bintu byaina bitapu. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kamutabwela kunyuma, pakwinga kuntangu kuli cilambo cinene. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ikalikani nkombe kwambeti mwinse cena luyando lwa Lesa ne kutambula bintu mbyalamulaya. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Mbuli ncecalembwa mu Mabala,</para>
  <para style="q">“Kulashalowa kacindi kang'ana</para>
  <para style="q">neye lesanga</para>
  <para style="q">nteti akacelwepo sobwe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Lelo bantu bakame balulama nibakashome kayi nibakekale bayumi.</para>
  <para style="q">Nomba na umo mulyendibo umfutatila,</para>
  <para style="q">nteti kakondwepo sobwe.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nomba ntafwe bantu beshi kubwela kunyuma ne kutaika sobwe.</para>
  <para style="q">Tukute lushomo kayi twapuluka.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lushomo nicani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lushomo ni lushinisho lwa bintu bilapembelwanga mwakubula kutonshanya nambi nkatula bibononga. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Cebo ca lushomo lwabo bantu bakaindi Lesa walikukondwa nabo. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pakuba ne lushomo tukute kwinshibeti Lesa walasebenseshowa maswi pa kulenga kwilu ne cishi capanshi. Kayi tucinsheti bintu bilabonekenga byalabapo kufuma ku bintu bitaboneke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Abelo walabenga mulumbo waina kuli Lesa wapita wa Kaini. Lushomo lwakendi elwalapesheti Lesa amwambeti muntu walulama, pakwinga Lesa walatambula bipo byakendi. Nambi Abelo walafwa kaindi, ne lelo ucamba cebo ca lushomo lwakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Pakwinga Enoki walashoma Lesa ecebo cakendi uliya kufwa. Paliya walamucanapo, pakwinga Lesa walamumanta Kwilu. Mabala alambangeti, Lesa walakondwa ne mbyalikwinsa Enoki katana mantwa Kwilu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Paliya wela kumukondwelesha Lesa kwabula lushomo, neco uyo lesanga kuli Lesa ashometi Lesa nkwali, kayi ukute kupa cilambo balamulangaulunga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lushomo elwalapesheti Nowa anyumfwe kucenjesha kwa Lesa pa bintu byali kwisa kuntangu mbyali kubula kubona. Walanyumfwila Lesa pa kwibaka bwato bunene mwalapulukila ne mukowa wakendi. Ici calalesheti bantu balikuba baipa, pakwinga Nowa walatambula bululami kuli Lesa cebo ca lushomo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Abulahamu walanyumfwila Lesa pa cindi ncalamukuwa kushiya cishi ca comwabo kuya kucishi ncalamulaya kumupa. Walashiya cishi cakendi katakwinshi nkwalikuya. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mu lushomo lwakendi walikwikaleti mwensu mu cishi ico Lesa ncalamulaya kumupa. Walikwikalowa mu matente, mbuli Isaki, kayi ne Yakobo ncebalikwikala abo balatambulako cipangano ca Lesa ca mushoboyo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Abulahamu walikupembelela, munshi webakwa mu lulindi lwekalikana, munshi webakwa mwabuya, webakwa ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mu lushomo, Abulahamu walapewa ngofu shakusema bana mubucekulu nambi Sala walikuba ng'umba. Walaba ne mwana cebo ca lushomo.Walikuba washoma Lesa kwambeti nakakwanilishe ncalamulaya. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nambi Abulahamu walikubeti wafwa, nsombi mu muntuyu mwalafuma bana bangi batabelengeketi nyenyenshi sha kwilu nambi museya wa mu mulonga.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Aba bonse balafwa kabali bashoma, baliya kutambula bintu mbyalabalaya Lesa, nikukabeco balikubibona ne kubitambula kabicili patali. Kayi balasumina pantangalala kwambeti ni bensu beshikwikala kwa kulonga longa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bantu bakute kwambeco pantangalala bakute kupembelela kupewa cishi cabo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pakwinga nkabali kuyeya kubwelela kucishi nkobalafuma, nibalikuyeyeco nshinga nibalabwelela kucishi nkobalafuma. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Balo balalangaula cishi caina, cishi ca kwilu. Neco Lesa nkela kunyumfwa nsoni bamukuwangeti Lesa wabo, pakwinga walababambila munshi. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Abulahamu pa cindi Lesa ncalamusunka walabenga Isaki mwanendi kuba mulumbo kuli Lesa. Abulahamu ewalalaiwa ne Lesa, nomba kayi walikuba walibambila kutwala mwanendi enka ngwali kukute kwambeti abe mulumbo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lesa walamwambileti, “Kufumina muli Isaki nukabe ne bashikulu mbondakulaya.” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Abulahamu walikuba washoma mwakutatonshanya kwambeti Lesa wela kumupundusha Isaki nambi lafu, neco mukwelanika ngatwambeti Abulahamu walamutambula Isaki kufuma ku bafu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Mu lushomo, Isaki walalaila limo banabendi, Yakobo ne Esau sha colwe nceshi bakabe naco ku masuba akuntangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Yakobo katana afwa walapa colwe bana ba Yosefe, kali washintilila pa nkoli kakambilila Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Yosefe katana afwa walambeti bana Baislayeli nibakafume mu Injipito, kayi walashiya malailile a nceti bakense pa mafupa akendi akafwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mu lushomo bashali ba Mose balamusoleka kwa myenshi itatu mpwalasemwa. Kwapa kwa mwana ekwalapeti bataluke mulawo wa mwami kwa kubula buyowa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mulushomo Mose mpwalakula,walakana kukwiweti mushukulu wa mwami wa ku Injipito. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Walacibona kuba cintu caina kupengela pamo ne bantu ba Lesa kupita kukondwa ne malyalya a bwipishi kwa kacindi kang'ana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Walasalapo kusulwa cebo ca Klistu Mupulushi Wananikwa wa Lesa kuba cintu caina kupita buboni bonse bwa mu Injipito, pakwinga walasha menso akendi pa cilambo ca kuntangu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Mose walafuma mu Injipito kwakubula kutina bukalu bwa mwami. Walakana kubwela pakwinga walikubeti labononga Lesa utaboneke. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Mose walabamba kusekelela kwa Pasika kayi ne kupa mulawo wa kusansaila milopa pa bisasa kwambeti mungelo katesa ashine bana bakutanguna kusema ba bana Baislayeli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mu lushomo Baislayeli balatampuka lwenje lwafubela, Nomba bashilikali ba ku Injipito nabo mpobalelekesha kubatampukila, balaya nkwela ne menshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Mu lushomo malinga a munshi wa Yeliko alalokolomoka kuwa panshi nti! Pa cindi Baislayeli mpobalaushinguluka pelete munshi wa Yeliko masuba asanu ne abili.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lahabi mufule walashoma muli Lesa, ecebo cakendi neye ne bansebendi baliya kufwila pamo ne bantu balikubula kunyumfwila Lesa, pakwinga walabatambula Baislayeli balatumwa kuya kutapa cishi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Sena mpitilishe kwamba? Ndiya cindi citali ca kwamba sha lushomo lwa Gidiyoni ne Balaki ne Samisoni ne Yefita ne Dafeti ne Samiyele kayi ne bashinshimi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Mu lushomo aba bantu balalwana nkondo ne kukoma bishi bingi. Balensa ncalikuyanda Lesa, balatambula ncalabalaya Lesa. Balacala milomo ya nkalamo, <verse number="34" style="v"/>balashima mulilo walikubangila, kayi baliya kufwapo ku censho. Nambi balikuba balefuka, nsombi balapewa ngofu. Balikwinshi mwakulwanina nkondo, kayi balakoma makoto ankondo abalwani. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Mu lushomo batukashi balatambula banse babo balikuba bafwa, nsombi balapunduka ku bafu. Nabambi pakukana kusungululwa balapenshekwa kwine mpaka balafwa kwambeti bakapundukile kubuyumi bwaina. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Bambi balawelwa, bambi balaumwa bikoti, kayi nabambi balasungwa ncetani ne kuwalwa mu jele. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nabambi balapwaiwa mabwe, bambi mibili yabo yalatimbulwa pakati, nabambi balashinwa ne byensho. Nabambi balabapitanya kabali babafwalika mpaya sha mbelele nambi sha mpongo. Balikuba bapenshi, balapenshewa kayi balalingwa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Cishi capanshi nkacalabelela sobwe, balaba beshi kufwambila mu binyika ne mumilundu, kona mu maceni ne mubilindi eti bantu babula cishi cabo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ha! Bantu aba bonse nambi Lesa balabalumbaisha cebo lushomo lwabo, nikukabeti baliya kutambula bintu mbyalabalaya Lesa! <verse number="40" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa mububambo bwakendi utukutile bintu byaina kwine. Kuyanda kwakendi ni kwa kwambeti afwe pamo nendibo tushike pakuba belela cakupwililila.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lesa Bata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Afwe tukute mulongo unene watushinguluka wa bakamboni. Neco katutayani ciliconse cilatucelweshenga ne bwipishi bwatulangatila, katufwambani mwakutabwela panyuma mu lubilo ndotulimo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Katushani menso pali Yesu apo mpotwebaka lushomo lwetu kufuma pacitatiko mpaka ku mapwililisho. Yesu uliya kutamauka cebo ca lufu lwakendi lwa pa lunsanda, nsombi cebo ca kupembelela kukondwa, nendi uliya kutina kufwa pa lusanda mwakusampulwa. Pa cindi cino wekala ku cikasa ca kululyo ca Cipuna ca bwami ca Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kamuyeyani bintu mbyalapitamo, ncobalamupata bantu babwipishi. Neco kamutanyumfwa butolo nambi kutentuka sobwe. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Pakwinga mukulwana ne bwipishi nkamuna mushika pakwinsa kushinwa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mulalubu maswi akuyuminisha ngalamba Lesa kuli njamwe mobana bendi batuloba ne batukashi ngalambeti, “Omwaname, konyumfwila Mwami akululamikanga, kayi kotatyompwa akucancililanga. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pakwinga Mwami ukute kukalalila muntu ngwasuni ne kupa cisubulo uliyense ngwalatambulu eti mwana.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamupitani mumapensho kwambeti mwiyepo mikalilo yaina. Lesa lenshingeti mobanabendi. Sena pali mwana ngobatapa cisubulo baishi? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na mubula kupewa cisubulo mobanabendi bonse, ekwambeti ntamwe bana bancine ncine, mobana ba mubufule. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Bameshetu bapacishi capanshi batupanga cisubulo tukute kubapa bulemu, inga cilyeconi lino ncotwela kubanyumfwila Bameshetu bakwilu ne kuba bayumi? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bameshetu bapa cishi capanshi bakute kutupa cisubulo kwa kacindi kang'anowa mbuli ncebalayandanga, nomba Lesa ukute kutwinshileco kwambeti tucane caina, kwambeti tucanemo lubasu mu kuswepa kwakendi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Twapewanga cisubulo tukute kuboneti tulasampuku nkatukute kukondwapo. Nomba panyuma pakendi bantu bakute kololwa ne cisubulo bakute kucana cilambo ca bote ca buyumi bwalulama.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi a malailile kayi ne akucenjesha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kamwimanikani makasa enu alefuka, kayi yumishani manungo enu atontola! <verse number="13" style="v"/>Endani munshila yololoka cena kwambeti myendo yenu yalemana, kaitombankana, nsombi isengulwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Elekeshani kwikala mulumuno ne bantu bonse, kayi elekeshani kwikala mu buyumi bwaswepa, pakwinga paliya eshakamubone Mwami kwakubula kwikala mubuyumi bwaswepa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Cenjelani, kamutafutatila kwina moyo kwa Lesa. Kakutaba muntu wakoshaneti citondo calula cikute kuleta makatasho angi ne kulula kwaco na cilakulu. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kakutaba mufule nambi wasula Lesa mbuli Esau walaulisha bukulene bwakendi bwakusemwa ne mbale ya cakulya. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Mucinshi kwambeti panyuma pakendi walayanda kutambula colwe ku baishi, nomba balamutandanya, pakwinga uliya kucana nshila njelakushintilamo cintu ncalensa mwine nambi walikuyanda kensa kulilako misoshi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Amwe muliya kwinsa mbuli ncebalensa Baislayeli, abo balashika nekuya kukumya mulundu wa Sinai usa walikubangila mulilo, washipa mbi, wacipupu, <verse number="19" style="v"/>kulila kwa tolompita kayi ne kunyumfwika kwa liswi lya Lesa ndyalikwamba. Mpobalanyumfwa liswi ndyalikwamba Lesa, bantu balamba mwangofu eti nkabasuni kwanyufwa tubili maswi alico. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pakwinga balatina mulawo wa Lesa walikwambeti, “Na muntu nambi munyama uya ukumya mulundu wela kupwaiwa mabwe nekufwa.” <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mbyobalabona pa mulundu wa Sinai byalabayosha bantu cakwinseti Mose walambeti “Ndatutumunga cebo cabuyowa.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Nomba amwe mulesa ku mulundu wa Siyoni munshi wa Lesa muyumi, Yelusalemu wa kwilu uko kuli bangelo batabelengeke balasekelelenga pamo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mulesa ku mubungano wa bana ba Lesa bakutanguna abo balembwa maina kwilu. Mulesa kuli Lesa momboloshi wa bantu bonse, ne ku mishimu ya bantu baina balalulamikwa cakupwililila ne Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mulesa kuli Yesu uyo walabamba cipangano calinolino uyo mwine walasansailo milopa, latulayanga bintu byaina kupita milopa ya Abelo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Neco, cetukani, nyumfwilani Lesa lambanga. Balashinka matwi abo kunyumfwila Lesa walikubapa mulumbe wa kubacenjesha pano pacishi baliya kupuluka sobwe. Inga kupuluka kwetu ngakuba kung'aneconi na tufutatila Klistu lambanga kwilu! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Maswi a Lesa alatenkanya cishi capanshi pa cindico, nsombi lino kayi lashomeshengeti “Nteti nkatenkanyowa cishi capanshi nsombi ninkatenkanye ne kwilu konse.” <verse number="27" style="v"/>Maswi akwambeti “lino kayi” Alaleshengeti bintu byonse byalalengwa nibikatenkane kayi nibikafumepo, kwambeti bintu byela kubula kutenkana bishalepo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Neco, katulumbani Lesa, pakwinga tulatambulu Bwami butatenkana. Katulumbani ne kukambilila Lesa mwakumukondwelesha mwabulemu ne buyowa, <verse number="29" style="v"/>pakwinga Lesa wetu cakubinga ulyeti mulilo ukute kunyekesha cakupwililila.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Motwela kumukondweleshela Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kamupitilishani kusunana umo ne munendi mbuli banse baciklistu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kamutambulanga bensu mu manda enu, pakwinseco, nabambi balatambula bangelo mwakuteshiba. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kamubayeyanga bantu banenu bali mujele, kubeti mwasungilwa pamo. Kamubayeyanga banenu balapengenga kubeti mulapengelenga pamo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Cikwati cela kupewa bulemu ne bantu bonse, kayi bulili bwacikwati bube bwabula kusafwana, pakwinga Lesa lakomboloshonga bonse bakute nsala ya bukome ne kwinsa bupombo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamutaba beshi kuyandishisha mali, mbyomukute bimukwanine. Ntepasa Lesa walambeti, “Nteti nkakushiyepo nambi kukutaya sobwe.” <verse number="6" style="v"/>Katuyumishani myoyo kayi twambeti, “Mwami Lesa eshikunyamfwa, paliya nceti nkatine. Anu nicani ncela kunjinsa muntu?”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kamubayeyanga batangunishi abo balamwambila mulumbe wa Lesa. Yeyani cendo ne lufu lwabo, kamukonkelani lushomo lwabo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesu Klistu uliya kushintapo lilo, nkela kushinta lelo, kayi nteti akashintepo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutaleka biyisho bya bwepeshi bimupatushe pa nshila ya cancine ncine.Caina kwambeti kwinamoyo kwa Lesa kuyumishe myoyo yetu, kutambeti kukonkelowa milawo ilambanga sha byakulya, pakwinga bonse balakonkelenga milawo iyi paliya nceyalabenshila.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Beshimilumbo bali kusebensa mu Tente ya Lesa nkabelela kumantapo pa milumbo ya kulumbanya nkotukute kubenga pa nteme yetu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mukulene wa Shimilumbo wa Ciyuda wali kutwala mulumbo wa milopa ya banyama mu Cipinda Caswepeshesha, kwambeti ifunye bwipishi, nsombi mitunta ya banyama balikuya kwitentela kunsa kwamishasha. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Pacebo cilico, neye Yesu walafwila kunsa kwa munshi kwambeti asambishe bwipishi bantu ne milopa yakendi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Neco katuyani kuli Yesu kumishasha twenga tusampulwe pamo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Pakwinga pano pa cishi capanshi paliya munshi wekalikana ngotwela kwikalamo cindi conse, tulapembelelenga munshi ulesanga. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Neco, katutwalani mulumbo cindi conse kuli Lesa kupitila muli Yesu, mulumbo wa milomo yetu ilasuminishingeti, Yesu ni Mwami. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kamutalubako kwinsa byaina kayi ne kunyamfwana umo ne munendi, pakwinga iyi emilumbo ikute kumukondwelesha Lesa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kamunyumfwilani batangunishi benu pa kukonkela malailile abo, pakwinga ebalembelenga buyumi bwenu eti bene beti bakapewe mulandu kuli Lesa. Na kamubanyumfwila inga basebensa ncito mwakukondwa, nomba na mubula kwinseco, nga basebensa ca nsoni, ico nkacela kumunyamfwa sobwe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Pitilishani kutupaililako, nambi tucisheti tuliya miyeyo yaipa, nsombi tulayandanga kwinsowa bintu byalulama cindi conse. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kayi ndamusengenga ca moyo umo kwambeti Lesa akantume ca lino lino kuli njamwe.</para>
  <para style="s">Mupailo wa kupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lesa walamupundusha Mwami wetu Yesu, mwembeshi mukulene wa mbelele cebo ca milopa yakendi yalaba lushinisho lwa cipangano camuyayaya. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Neco Lesa wa lumuno amupe bintu byaina mbyomulayandanga pakwinsa luyando lwakendi. Kayi kupitila muli Yesu Klistu tumukondweleshe kwelana ne kuyanda kwakendi. Kuli Klistu kube bulemeneno kwa muyayaya.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mobanse ndamusengenga kamunyumfwishishani maswi akumuyuminisha awa, pakwinga nkalata iyi njondalembe nifupi, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ndayandangeti mwinshibeti mwanse wetu Timoti lafumu mujele.Na ese calino lino, ninkese nendi ndakesanga uko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mutupeleko mitende batangunishi benu ne bantu bonse ba Lesa. Banse ba ku Italiya balamupanga mitende.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kwina moyo kwa Lesa kube ne njamwe mwense.</para>
</usx>
